  <metadata>
    <name>Day 3 - Alamo NV to Capitol Reef NP</name>
    <desc>US-93 N through Caliente and Panaca NV, NV-319 to Utah, UT-56 to Cedar City, UT-14 E through Dixie National Forest, US-89 N, UT-12 E scenic byway through Escalante and Boulder, UT-24 W to Capitol Reef NP. 369 miles.</desc>
